1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,697
To‘qson birinchi daqiqa.

2
00:00:01,717 --> 00:00:03,580
Hisob ikki — ikki.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,822
Bu zarbani sizlardan biri urdi.

4
00:00:05,842 --> 00:00:07,362
Kim — oxirida.

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,863
Ikkala tarkib ham siz tanlagansiz.

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,280
Hisobni Prime Fc ochdi.

7
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,146
Javob darhol keldi.

8
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,680
Prime Fc yana oldinga chiqdi.

9
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,539
Va yana tenglik.

10
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,864
Mana o‘sha zarba.

11
00:00:19,884 --> 00:00:22,580
Sakkiz raqamli o‘yinchi — g‘alaba goli.

12
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,262
Uch — ikki.

13
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,494
Gol urganlarning ismi ekranda.

14
00:00:26,514 --> 00:00:28,474
Hammasi — muxlislar.

15
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:33,146
Ertaga ikkinchi yarim final: Qayrat Fc — Prime Avangard.

16
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,539
Izohga qaysi klub yutishini yozing.

17
00:00:35,559 --> 00:00:38,539
To‘g‘ri topganlardan uch kishi final tarkibiga kiradi.

18
00:00:38,559 --> 00:00:40,959
Yigirma to‘rt soat, obuna shart.

